  <entry xml:lang="en">
    <title>🎤 Esri European Developer &amp; Technology Summit 2026</title>
    <link href="https://posts.rauljimenez.info/events/2026/09/01/esri-european-developer-and-technology-summit"/>
    <id>https://posts.rauljimenez.info/events/2026/09/01/esri-european-developer-and-technology-summit</id>
    <published>2026-09-01T14:25:03.862Z</published>
    <updated>2026-09-01T14:25:03.862Z</updated>
    <category term="event"/>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;At the upcoming edition of our developer conference (Esri Developer and Technology Summit) in Frankfurt, I will be presenting several talks:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://registration.esri.com/flow/esri/26euroepcdev/deveventportal/page/detailed-agenda/session/1785481365243001f1yI&quot;&gt;AI-Infused Development: Lessons Learned and Patterns from Esri Engineers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://registration.esri.com/flow/esri/26euroepcdev/deveventportal/page/detailed-agenda/session/1785493533691001yG2g&quot;&gt;Authentication: A Practical Approach to Security in ArcGIS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://registration.esri.com/flow/esri/26euroepcdev/deveventportal/page/detailed-agenda/session/1785487648507001JydR&quot;&gt;Security and Authentication for Custom Applications&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://registration.esri.com/flow/esri/26euroepcdev/deveventportal/page/detailed-agenda/session/1785496248538001cWVi&quot;&gt;Working with ArcGIS REST JS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://registration.esri.com/flow/esri/26euroepcdev/deveventportal/page/detailed-agenda/session/1785488466631001lUg0&quot;&gt;Building Beautiful Interactive Mapping Applications with ArcGIS Basemap Services&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://registration.esri.com/flow/esri/26euroepcdev/deveventportal/page/detailed-agenda/session/1785488070964001MGwx&quot;&gt;Vector Tile Style Editor: Deep Customization of ArcGIS Basemaps&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More info: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.esri.com/en-us/about/events/euro-devtech/overview&quot;&gt;https://www.esri.com/en-us/about/events/euro-devtech/overview&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
  </entry>
